{"content":[{"c":["ZABAD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Nathan (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.36","r":"1Chr.2.36","rawR":"1Chr.2.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.36","value":"1Chr.2.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:36"},") and a descendant of Ahlai the daughter of Sheshan (vv ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.30,34-36","r":"1Chr.2.30,34-36","rawR":"1Chr.2.30,34-36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.30,34-36","value":"1Chr.2.30,34-36"}],"t":"ref","v":"30, 34-36"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Tahath’s son and the father of Shuthelah from Ephraim’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.21","r":"1Chr.7.21","rawR":"1Chr.7.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.21","value":"1Chr.7.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. One of David’s mighty men, listed as a son of Ahlai (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.41","r":"1Chr.11.41","rawR":"1Chr.11.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.41","value":"1Chr.11.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:41"},"); he is perhaps the same as #1 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of the assassins of King Joash, listed as the son of Shimeath the Ammonitess (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.24.26","r":"2Chr.24.26","rawR":"2Chr.24.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.24.26","value":"2Chr.24.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 24:26"},"). He is identical to Jozacar (alternately “Jozabad”) in ",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.12.21","r":"2Kgs.12.21","rawR":"2Kgs.12.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.12.21","value":"2Kgs.12.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kings 12:21"},". Zabad was a palace official who was likely the agent of a powerful conspiracy against Joash."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=JozacarJozachar_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"JozacarJozachar_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"JozacarJozachar_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Jozacar, Jozachar"},"."],"sourceClass":"list-text","t":"p"},{"c":["5–7. Three priests variously descended from Zattu, Hashum, and Nebo, who renounced their foreign wives at Ezra’s request during the postexilic period (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.27,33,43","r":"Ezra.10.27,33,43","rawR":"Ezra.10.27,33,43","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.27,33,43","value":"Ezra.10.27,33,43"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:27, 33, 43"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Zabad","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.36","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.36","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.36"},{"anchorText":"30, 34-36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.30,34-36","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.30,34-36","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.30,34-36"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.21","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.21","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:41","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.41","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.41","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.41"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 24:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.24.26","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.24.26","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.24.26"},{"anchorText":"2 Kings 12:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.12.21","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.12.21","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.12.21"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:27, 33, 43","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.27,33,43","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.27,33,43","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.27,33,43"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"6eea236d40ecb475311fd8a81d6b08b77cde7be5a5dd1dde4516ec66462a8124","sourceItemName":"Zabad","sourceItemOrder":5,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Zabad","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zabad","title":"Zabad","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}